{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/9bzrvbuy9ey2yre4pr7xfintqa7cmai.mp3","text":"我来帮忙了，说吧，接下来要打谁？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/33rrjrktho93zifkuc6vw39eweogp2q.mp3","text":"未经许可你就不能外出走动？这里是谁管事啊，不是你吗？真麻烦，总之快跟我一起出门走走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/52ly8vzy8zdfyhyzhl25893t2t1j3ih.mp3","text":"你刚才有话要说吗？我戴着耳机没听见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/soes55w67rfcjmtqyergh1zbrsr82sq.mp3","text":"罗德岛的首领看起来比真理年纪还小吧，你怎么能让那样的孩子上战场？嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/en3tcedee8mzymoyzsw0cnbu9heykxx.mp3","text":"为什么我成天盯着你？我就是想看看，看看你这家伙每天都在做什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/s99t5rkt2spoblckpt55hms6mdhnwe6.mp3","text":"所有的士兵都想当上将军，那么，我想取代你好像也没什么问题吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/nd88sq3oggcnzy056c3sz1mgyahwbqf.mp3","text":"未来的打算？没想过那种事。怎么，有什么不满吗？我们又不是那种需要为将来做打算的年龄。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/oosx2b2leg93hwqouiicowkei5nfb5j.mp3","text":"真理她们是我在路上捡到的，不过一开始可不只有她们几个人。你问其他人在哪？哦......收拾掉了，因为那些家伙，不怎么老实。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/jhx8xgt8snpuamle6t6vd73pe5b4yo2.mp3","text":"切尔诺伯格？谁要回一个没有希望的城市？现在罗德岛才是我们真正的起点。就是这样，以后还请多担待点喽，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/f7r6b7m7b4gfqjbnfer139kihwpbjeh.mp3","text":"......这就没事做了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/m6vdwyfi0vsn9oowujz0wbkjuxdwhng.mp3","text":"凛冬，乌萨斯学生自治团团长。我自己怎么样无所谓，但现在我的同伴需要一个安身之处。好了，快给我安排些工作，我知道在这里生活不是免费的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/6v2epvc7qhrf6xgqmluutgh43g5khen.mp3","text":"这个不赖嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/sm5mo7nv5dybw1wc20bfhqjqfcvela4.mp3","text":"晋升？有趣，也就是说只要一直取得战功，就能不断晋升下去，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/kt6pbzt617f9c8q0miquj3ulme4zvjb.mp3","text":"让我们相互坦白点吧，如果我一直晋升下去，最后就能取代你了吧？......玩笑话？不好意思啊，我可不是在开玩笑。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/g1ldq6fjaj2g5e361j97ow6w50l5x0j.mp3","text":"当队长还是队员，我都无所谓。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/e6aauotozc91a9lis7ajoms2n8urv8u.mp3","text":"麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/at4iwnbcort57x63zgehcgmdk13bpuk.mp3","text":"走了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/l79rbvnl5ml5476szl1wtx3rpv1dxh9.mp3","text":"上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/pzcpyzypvuh4rp51xlr98x1lejzxnlb.mp3","text":"当然，是我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/lcyt4r2wk35hmcnwrt6o2gwjww8ojmc.mp3","text":"我要去战斗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/al25ti1vs81xp9i39y9flb0s8m1iqky.mp3","text":"胆小鬼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/rg1pks4bw7xj7jiy1ubb5datfe7b19p.mp3","text":"哼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/f5sbkim1mgudytcotqcfu4k5pyqz1zr.mp3","text":"怕什么！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/0hjfhfbdei5u6vkendgtcf4c3kt90wx.mp3","text":"你们一口气上吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/nh99dfkdfrtp58n6t77yd71678v9m9r.mp3","text":"力量与荣耀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/242h0gtgsgereazsi1oqbpqp00i166e.mp3","text":"胜利与死亡！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/1nckjccblk1tloo7t784tsy8xlrgx2p.mp3","text":"急着送命就来找我，我这里不需要排队。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/gxqb8i64r54wn9y4prnw5vq1nio11vm.mp3","text":"不错的战果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/fd26vd822aadukrkbxvisf6n35rtprf.mp3","text":"反正，这地盘现在是我们的了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/e3gc5y8gq78rtka30wzghlc8sqyrdbs.mp3","text":"丢人，你马上给我退出战场！","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/l95v28e2bdbq2w6ldxmdhsujmosdemr.mp3","text":"这是什么地方？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/anq6nlzb3jl6v2pnigk72g7odhpka8g.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/024f5k3hoq0hwkr3abqf22bt0x4pgoc.mp3","text":"嘿，最近你的指挥越来越像样了，是不是觉得打架也挺有趣的？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/8k9z7qgerjo2a3djql9sc38gg8wtcg8.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/7ekn7zyfxh0lp8t0ew31my6acgyftsi.mp3","text":"哦，早上好。今天好吵啊。真是，明明都是大人了，怎么还会因为新年这么兴奋......喂，你怎么还坐在这，难道打算在新年的第一天坐在这里度过吗？快跟我出去。我专门买了好多烟花呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/0tzdw83iuk66bca2tim21tjfrg4ents.mp3","text":"干什么？有事吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_115_headbr/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/mthymr4s5jn15rlb0jzkzpiw0y7u75e.mp3","text":"我来帮忙了，说吧，接下来要打谁？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/pf6jgighks9ffietk23o77fz3zqvr86.mp3","text":"未经许可你就不能外出走动？这里是谁管事啊，不是你吗？真麻烦，总之快跟我一起出门走走。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/t7xkd46arhn72bz2cwcxp5ztv1fkbia.mp3","text":"你刚才有话要说吗？我戴着耳机没听见。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/izxs4rqxqwihp5ppge4odiw5dcfub76.mp3","text":"罗德岛的首领看起来比真理年纪还小吧，你怎么能让那样的孩子上战场？嗯？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/merzksjfaw34o9tzct6uxj9n82ekal2.mp3","text":"为什么我成天盯着你？我就是想看看，看看你这家伙每天都在做什么。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/rk4bpiflmugckzjf1w56fi17juoqke3.mp3","text":"所有的士兵都想当上将军，那么，我想取代你好像也没什么问题吧？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/kbcjppehljxac8tvgnnye8ii7x2ooti.mp3","text":"未来的打算？没想过那种事。怎么，有什么不满吗？我们又不是那种需要为将来做打算的年龄。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/6z3ot0onbp202mhtgamb3ijapqn56xa.mp3","text":"真理她们是我在路上捡到的，不过一开始可不只有她们几个人。你问其他人在哪？哦......收拾掉了，因为那些家伙，不怎么老实。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/a941q9m7xhcc2p2cg7622jkkc10uxsg.mp3","text":"切尔诺伯格？谁要回一个没有希望的城市？现在罗德岛才是我们真正的起点。就是这样，以后还请多担待点喽，博士。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/h2bb6sy4evc11zuqo40jk1pqzbdaqlg.mp3","text":"......这就没事做了？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/obiihft7f2f4g6mfy0dojfvh75jfu2i.mp3","text":"凛冬，乌萨斯学生自治团团长。我自己怎么样无所谓，但现在我的同伴需要一个安身之处。好了，快给我安排些工作，我知道在这里生活不是免费的。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/6febjosct7i3fsm6whfbeqmt6p0os9m.mp3","text":"这个不赖嘛。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/8szcgbuazabawmwemwqfwlwn38wrzau.mp3","text":"晋升？有趣，也就是说只要一直取得战功，就能不断晋升下去，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/0htljb2ftzhgs1ms8b9nvo68odotddk.mp3","text":"让我们相互坦白点吧，如果我一直晋升下去，最后就能取代你了吧？......玩笑话？不好意思啊，我可不是在开玩笑。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/fen3axoj5plftpjfm8fv6g9csmecvnh.mp3","text":"当队长还是队员，我都无所谓。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/klgd97hmdv8zdoel1z1jicib0vzsnf8.mp3","text":"麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/7eyyxjqwhobuubazts12xas39ajs52v.mp3","text":"走了。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/tnypafjxeiawegi3tq2tiwa4rkwty4u.mp3","text":"上。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/b3t1k6jxp52ivm1sdgz6isw68zakfgn.mp3","text":"当然，是我！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/kjomqu0urrwyhukbve0meboh9ea0903.mp3","text":"我要去战斗。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/jfqp5d4zm2pk7eipxvvh7qqo7jdwyng.mp3","text":"胆小鬼。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/6b6ufn2f8z1ldin6xjpqjubc5cg3qi3.mp3","text":"哼。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/6abgtr2cb7zkdet9vhtfy0s3um030l2.mp3","text":"怕什么！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/dj9slciwlev6fehpk3liw6jqadnr4vk.mp3","text":"你们一口气上吧！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/amytb8a4mthkkyp4v4edo4kfxpigrww.mp3","text":"力量与荣耀！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/f96jti5mjsckf3opdah9nbptd650ydp.mp3","text":"胜利与死亡！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/qc6fax78ftnymphaohc6h20hjlp791l.mp3","text":"急着送命就来找我，我这里不需要排队。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/ojn69qno4l1a19p1w32lv26j4fym19t.mp3","text":"不错的战果。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/jdw2rozrlj6fh5bk0q7mafmikn408c7.mp3","text":"反正，这地盘现在是我们的了。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/hha06wizydy1e1borq75dietyjbm3rw.mp3","text":"丢人，你马上给我退出战场！","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/9o3wiqo88qic7vfsezaq45up0c5820f.mp3","text":"这是什么地方？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/lw3vd08j2811joegnfhzd7ugmh887a7.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/frvi6jtt8uizagep0bmog6i5tfu3yak.mp3","text":"嘿，最近你的指挥越来越像样了，是不是觉得打架也挺有趣的？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/0yiw9tqban61mv73ylun1qx7eymcccp.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/0yq0ftgmzi5whjcsnj51otsjd7pbvbf.mp3","text":"哦，早上好。今天好吵啊。真是，明明都是大人了，怎么还会因为新年这么兴奋......喂，你怎么还坐在这，难道打算在新年的第一天坐在这里度过吗？快跟我出去。我专门买了好多烟花呢。","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/od48hv8p2nsp3kiig6ld3gc85jq0s7h.mp3","text":"干什么？有事吗？","alt":"voice/char_115_headbr/cn_042.mp3"}]}}